  "bodyHash": "e63eca888e4ed8cc",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252fmodpacks%252frestless-horizons%252forder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_ad9141f9-bcd5-46c5-81b9-605644d54d39.png\"></a><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_f7d7ab87-d0a6-4337-a314-88c98bec2e2b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">*非官方</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:2.8em;color:#e03e2d;text-transform:uppercase\">焕然一新的残酷。</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#bbb;font-size:1.15em\">RLCraft的核心机制，置于现代宇宙之中</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#777\">专为 <strong style=\"color:#ddd\">@Lyzerrah</strong> 频道制作 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">特别感谢 <strong>SomeKoifee</strong> 与 <strong>VelkhanaV2</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#777\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#1a0000;border:1px solid #e03e2d;color:#e03e2d\">⚠️ &nbsp;新玩家：请在视频设置中将<strong style=\"color:#fff\">GUI比例设置为3</strong>以查看完整HUD！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#1a0000;border:1px solid #e03e2d;color:#e03e2d\">⚠️ &nbsp;新玩家：请移除HUD指南针以使用Essential</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong style=\"color:#fff\">RLCraft定义了一代人的苦难</strong> &mdash; 但它仍停留在1.12.2版本。Restless Horizons 将 RLCraft 传奇的一切从头重构，采用全新理念使其更富乐趣且以玩家为核心。内置大量整合内容与丰厚的任务奖励！如果你曾对RLCraft无感，或许会爱上这个整合包！&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:100%;border:2px solid #7b1a13\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_a9d0f822-b3e9-471c-8f06-d2365e4d9a02.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#e03e2d;font-size:2.0em;text-transform:uppercase\">&nbsp; 前方有何挑战&nbsp;&nbsp;</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#888;font-style:italic\">这不仅仅是一个整合包。这是一次试炼。</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000;width:50%\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🩸 赐福枯萎怪 &amp; 终极枯萎怪</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">赐福枯萎怪掉落修复类物品，而终极枯萎怪的存在就是为了搞崩你的生存体验 :)</span></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000;width:50%\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🧸 手工打造自定义生物</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">为本整合包专门定制了类Lycanites风格的生物，并添加了其他多种细节改进！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🏢 地下花园的失落之城</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">失落之城现已迁至下花园维度，内含整个整合包中最顶级的装备！</span></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">📜 魔法并非易事</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">仅可通过卷轴施放Iron's Spells法术，以此平衡游戏性，但仍保留了一本法术书……</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚔️ 村庄即战区</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">找到友好聚落的概率极低，每个区域都处于争夺之中且危机四伏。</span></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">💣 地狱魔像、队长与SCP</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">无处是安全区。每个区域都在争夺之中。每个夜晚都充满威胁。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">☀️ 区域性生命值、温度与等级系统</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">几乎完全复刻了RLCraft的核心机制！</span></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🌑 禁止跳过夜晚</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">熬过残酷的月相事件（已添加自定义Lycanites风格事件）。出生点可获取日晷，用于应对恶劣的夜晚。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">🗼 重构的战斗塔与饰品</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">饰品散落在世界各地，你将邂逅经典与现代华丽的战斗塔！</span></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#140000\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">💀 大幅强化的灾厄Boss</strong><br><span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">自定义最终Boss正在开发中。目前奇美拉与刻耳柏洛斯是本整合包的专属Boss！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:rgb(20, 0, 0);text-align:left\"><strong style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚡ 性能优化</strong> &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <span style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px\">本整合包广受好评的一点就是性能表现。玩家在佩戴SUE（服务器端实体优化）和128x高清材质包的情况下仍能稳定运行在150帧。我高度重视性能优化。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"width:100%;border:2px solid #7b1a13\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_cd220891-8d11-4cd7-be0c-d54d268f5c27.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#666;font-style:italic\"><strong>新武器 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; 套装加成 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; 独家定制生物 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; 丰厚奖励任务</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#ccc;font-size:1.05em;line-height:1.8\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#e03e2d;font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:1.3em;font-style:italic\">“发现些你可能感兴趣的东西！”</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_23c53886-d59d-4643-afc7-e51145a06bdb.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_2bac6ea3-6e9b-432b-aae1-6df38c0ed059.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#666;font-style:italic\">Lycanites生物 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; 自定义替换 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; 30余种生物且持续增加中</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_c765d5ac-4377-4649-9870-8d3f07bf139c.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_40933551-1944-43c6-a7b0-1adb1068eb1f.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_3d7e8f22-8eb9-4a64-8d73-f5c0296fee35.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_a4f1bae2-b75a-4ccf-9140-9e33f5c4212c.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_d86b3e8f-308d-4ba5-8f9b-fa20d7903d8c.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_66556cf2-15b0-496a-bbaf-2da39622f569.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1454212/description_eb9010cf-4c79-4b61-8039-da4e8b20594d.gif\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Georgia, serif;color:#9b59b6;font-size:1.8em;text-transform:uppercase\">需要帮助？</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.15em\"><a style=\"color:#9b59b6;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"https://discord.gg/7V7xCvfTka\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">💬 &nbsp;加入Discord社区 &mdash; Lyzerrah Packs</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:1.15em\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fbIrzaqLm9Cw%253fsi%253dcevotS5oOMm0Gu7n\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">▶ &nbsp;观看完整整合包展示视频</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;color:#444;font-style:italic\">Restless Horizons &mdash; 现代版RLCraft &mdash; 1.20.1 Forge</p>",
